R, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/navigationTitle(_:)-7ercd":{"kind":"symbol","title":"navigationTitle(_:)","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/navigationTitle(_:)-7ercd","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"navigationTitle","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Text","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4TextV"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/navigationtitle(_:)-7ercd"}}}